1
00:00:11,465 --> 00:00:12,505
(Leonard:)Penny, are you okay?

2
00:00:12,675 --> 00:00:15,885
PENNY:
I'm fine, Leonard. Just go away.

3
00:00:16,554 --> 00:00:19,474
(Leonard:)I understand that breaking up
with someone can be very painful...

4
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:22,560
- Go away!
- Okay, feel better, bye.

5
00:00:27,731 --> 00:00:29,271
She doesn't wanna talk.

6
00:00:30,734 --> 00:00:31,774
(Sheldon:)Not surprising.

7
00:00:31,944 --> 00:00:36,404
Penny's emotional responses originate in the
primitive portion of brain, the amygdala.

8
00:00:36,574 --> 00:00:39,364
While speech is centered
in the recently developed neocortex.

9
00:00:39,535 --> 00:00:42,325
Former can overpower the latter
giving scientific credence...

10
00:00:42,496 --> 00:00:45,336
(Sheldon:)...to the notion
of being rendered speechless.

11
00:00:50,921 --> 00:00:52,961
Or maybe she just doesn't wanna talk.

12
00:00:55,593 --> 00:01:01,023
(Raj(entering):)Hey, look, I found an iPod.

